WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.680
This is your path.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.360
Everyone starts as an Explorer:

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.720
the short survey makes you a member and gives you your first badge.

00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:12.040
If you run something, your path takes you further.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:15.640
There is one for restaurants, event hosts,

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.700
creators, nonprofits and businesses adding plant-based options,

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:23.740
each with its own Guide, its own short survey and its own badge.

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:25.820
Take as many as fit.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:29.860
Your badges show on your profile, you pick your main one,

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:33.680
and each badge opens its Guide and the bounties that go with it.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:35.640
We want to hear from you.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.080
As a member, you shape where these paths go:

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:42.600
tell us which path you are waiting for, like group leaders,

00:00:42.520 --> 00:00:46.080
which is on its way, and let us know if something needs to be fixed.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:47.920
Membership is free.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:52.540
We ask for a short survey so we know real people are joining,

00:00:52.880 --> 00:00:55.140
and that keeps this community worth your time.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:56.840
Bring people with you:

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.960
invite your friends, your community, new Vegans and Pre-Vegans.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.700
And you earn points for everybody who joins using your link.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.980
That is the easiest way to grow your experience and open new doors in our

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.500
community.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.520
Find your path today.

